  "summary": "Security-research / proof-of-concept package: aedes_clusters (npm)",
  "details": "The package runs a preinstall hook that executes index.js, which collects system information (hostname, username, home directory, DNS servers) and reads /etc/passwd and /etc/hosts from the installer's machine. This data is exfiltrated via HTTPS POST to b5hv16nakzo45px5ga4ukkum8de52vqk[.]oastify[.]com (a Burp Collaborator / OAST exfiltration endpoint).",
